<div class="phaseborn-app">
  <div class="phaseborn-original">
    <img src="" alt="Face 1 - Original">
    <div class="original-info">
      <strong>Face 1 — Original</strong>
      <p>Always matches the token as it already is. You don't need to configure this phase.</p>
      <p class="original-meta"></p>
      <div class="original-actions">
        <button type="button" data-action="recaptureOriginal" title="Use the token's current appearance as Face 1">
          <i class="fas fa-camera"></i> Recapture
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-action="restoreOriginal" title="Snap the token back to Face 1 right now">
          <i class="fas fa-undo"></i> Restore Now
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="hint">
    Configure the <strong>extra</strong> phases below (from the 2nd one on). When the actor's
    remaining HP drops to the configured value (absolute HP, not %), the token switches
    automatically. Use the eye icon to preview how it will look without waiting for combat.
  </p>

  <div class="phaseborn-rows"></div>

  <footer class="phaseborn-footer">
    <button type="button" data-action="addRow"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Add Phase</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="save" class="bright"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save</button>
  </footer>
</div>
